# Block 4: a solid of carbon/epoxy given as a MAT9 (fibres along X) whose
# G11 and GE are tables of the frequency (MAT9F). The block is clamped on its
# base and shaken along X at one top corner.
AnisoMat3D;4;137755.;4592.;4592.;;;;10867.;4439.;;;;10867.;;;;5.E+3;;;3200.;;5.E+3;1.6E-9;;;;;;;;0.02
